// Committed. Non-secret build settings, plus an optional local override.
//
// The Meta client token is deliberately NOT in git: this repo is public.
// Put it in Local.xcconfig (gitignored, see Local.xcconfig.example).
// `#include?` is the optional form -- a missing Local.xcconfig is not an error,
// so a fresh clone still generates and builds. The app then has an empty
// ClientToken and Meta registration fails, which is the visible, correct symptom.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
